  {
   "id": "t_0e3d5f6afc0f72b29c58",
   "sourceHash": "0e3d5f6afc0f72b29c5878ff983edc9f7ad26ea1bef514792e6e2c10dff54add",
   "text": "多年来，我饱受偏头痛和鼻窦炎困扰，似乎没有什么能让我获得长期缓解。在 Kairali 住了一周后，我感受到了明显的变化。工作人员非常友善、专业，疗法有针对性且令人放松。我能感觉到头痛发作的次数减少了，鼻塞也在逐渐消退。Kairali 的阿育吠陀疗法真正改变了我的生活。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_d01cdc9c417659efb41e",
   "sourceHash": "d01cdc9c417659efb41e8c7398852ee8a9e7b28155c37446c41928c2e463bba1",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Jerry 先生[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b30ea8cf0b1d7c6fb7e4",
   "sourceHash": "b30ea8cf0b1d7c6fb7e409c17cd2fd3785264b8819e38361287aa5392becf1c6",
   "text": "来 Kairali 治疗偏头痛和鼻窦炎，是我做过的最好的选择之一。团队为我制定了个性化治疗计划，包括呼吸练习、草本疗法和饮食建议。几天之内，我的症状就明显减轻了。在我看来，任何受慢性疾病困扰的人都值得了解一下 Kairali。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Source typo 'visitKairali' (missing space) ignored in translation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_099dfd51a2bd6a0aa3ba",
   "sourceHash": "099dfd51a2bd6a0aa3bad67fc7b2676ce4ece9c36e923662181677b7708b9ce2",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Sonu Jha 先生[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_1b29839fd102ad5698b7",
   "sourceHash": "1b29839fd102ad5698b713e7770c1402a8b44d73461a300456bc49aa8ca47f96",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Alex 先生与 Joanne 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_120172414b0ec2801403",
   "sourceHash": "120172414b0ec280140323b51c8df346163e0dbb2fb044dbe98672d11fc66796",
   "text": "在 Kairali 的经历改变了我的生活。我来这里是为了治疗长期的偏头痛和鼻窦炎。通过量身定制的草本补充剂、疗法和舒缓按摩相结合，我的症状开始逐渐消退。宁静的环境和阿育吠陀医生的专业知识让我能够轻松放松，感受到被悉心照顾。我对自己的改善感到非常满意，也认识到阿育吠陀如何能够促进长期健康。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b5409841ae6859aa1c72",
   "sourceHash": "b5409841ae6859aa1c7230a009303b173c816b954ed11660015a41ee60ac3f2d",
   "text": "[[OPEN_1]]Janvi Roy 女士[[CLOSE_1]][[OPEN_2]]★★★★★[[CLOSE_2]][[OPEN_3]]5.0[[CLOSE_3]]",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_69a48882dca1a8e24f47",
   "sourceHash": "69a48882dca1a8e24f47acb1497e82748bb95960e8d8db566d016451048fc14d",
   "text": "如何区分偏头痛与鼻窦相关的头痛？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6ce8f26d93435b42d3b4",
   "sourceHash": "6ce8f26d93435b42d3b49317083421810a5c235deae195a6047abc264fe4f12b",
   "text": "请提供您的诊断结果、头痛病史和现有治疗情况，并询问该治疗方案是否适合您的诊断；新出现或发生变化的头痛症状需要接受医学评估，而非自行诊断。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_477b452680139aef0684",
   "sourceHash": "477b452680139aef0684990ff18e04395437df778cd414b3b50b8022ffb19c9f",
   "text": "温热药油从悬挂的黄铜容器中流淌到一位躺在木制治疗床上、双眼覆盖棉垫的患者额头上，一名 Kairali 治疗师站在她身旁",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned term 'guest' rendered as 患者 (patient)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f161b9d478aae858369c",
   "sourceHash": "f161b9d478aae858369ce6a5db1fbb29ff3b8e0b7b0d9ca8e786876844864a84",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师将温油从小黄铜容器中倒在一位躺在木制治疗床上的患者头顶的棉垫上，后方点着一支蜡烛",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
