   "sourceHash": "8b712df915bf97de6ee8df0ac676388809d67ad41141d48ce615356d40ea82fc",
   "text": "温油从悬挂的黄铜容器中流淌到一位双眼覆盖棉垫、平躺的患者额头上",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_6c601b203b63d65c0258",
   "sourceHash": "6c601b203b63d65c02583d6e40d909a121e4bc9d27f9b1993037cd136c3e7cd0",
   "text": "应对鼻窦炎与偏头痛的自然整体疗法",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_aaaa2a26113226861e53",
   "sourceHash": "aaaa2a26113226861e535867c426aba27db27777919be40b591a53ffb2b7bf7f",
   "text": "Kairali 治疗师扶稳悬挂的黄铜容器，温油流淌到一位躺在木制治疗床上的患者额头上",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_cf5fd48b9bc528a32524",
